@startuml get-interests
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/user/student/interests
caption CRB-55 · 재학생 기본정보 입력 화면에 내려줄 고정 관심 분야 목록

actor Client
participant "SignupStepGuard\nUserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "StudentController" as Controller
participant "StudentService" as Service
participant "InterestService" as InterestService

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/user/student/interests\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard
  SignupStepGuard → UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @SignupStep({ step: "profile", allowActive: true })
  pending: next_step = profile 일 때만 (이메일 인증 이후) / active: 항상 통과 (마이페이지 수정)
  @UserTypes("student")
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / User not found
  403 Signup step mismatch / User type not allowed
end ref
Guard -> Controller: getInterests()
Controller -> Service: getInterests()
Service -> InterestService: getNames()
InterestService --> Service: name[]
note right of InterestService
  서버 기동 시 interest 테이블에서 한 번 읽어 메모리에 보관한 목록 (DB 조회 없음)
  flow/interest-cache-bootstrap.puml
  화면에 띄울 추천 목록일 뿐, 저장 API 가 이 값만 받는 것은 아님
  순서는 sort_order
end note
Service --> Controller: { interests: string[] }
Controller --> Client: 200 { interests: ["반도체", "소프트웨어", ...] }

@enduml
